name: Wave 4C — unknown template formatter is a sourced compile error
description: ```
`{{ expr as a <formatter> }}` only accepts a formatter from the closed
`FormatterRegistry` set. A name outside that set (e.g. `percentage`) is a
hard MER2012 compile error naming the available formatters, not a silent
codegen no-op. The source is an external file (not `source_inline`) because
its fenced template body itself uses `\`\`\`` delimiters, which would
collide with `source_inline`'s own fence-closing rule.
```
tags: inform7, wave4, templates, formatters, error

source: wave4_4c_templates_unknown_formatter.meridian

expect_compile: fail
expect_error_kind: semantic
expect_error_contains: percentage
